window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>The king of the underworld saved me from the streets, treated me like a princess, and locked me in a tower. Then, he turned into a beast. There's a darkness in him. I've seen it face-to-face. </p> <p>He says I'm his light. But if our love is going to last, I'm going to have to be more than his princess. I need to become a queen.</p> <p><i>Queen of the Underworld </i>is the final chapter in Marcus and Cora's story.</p>"; 
